title: Project essentials
pid: eead44a5-e35c-4786-9494-9ecd4c42a9d0
body: |2-
  Skg is a local knowledge-graph editor. Its canonical data is in plaintext
  '.skg' files; the 'in-Rust graph' and Tantivy are session-lifetime stores.
  The Rust server is in
  'server/', with Emacs Lisp and Neovim clients in 'elisp/' and 'nvim/'. A
  server retains one interactive user and admits one interactive client at a
  time.

  For a task, start with the smallest relevant local source:
contains:
- 3eb55035-42bd-4107-9d8e-a3d198b593d5
